{
  "name": "SnapTrack",
  "description": "Studio 94 SnapTrack — a procedural PHP/MySQL photography studio management and booking system. Single index.php router dispatches role-based pages (admin, staff, client) rendered as server-side PHP with vanilla JS/CSS. Handles bookings, payments, inventory, loyalty tiers, feedback with Gemini AI analysis, MFA/TOTP and Google OAuth auth, PHPMailer/Resend email, and web push notifications. Deployed via Nixpacks to Railway.",
